  "description": "ELAHAB crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C210 H195 Eu5 O45,4(C7 H8). From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu1A (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu2A (Eu) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.602-5.224 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 88.13-161.80°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Eu5(OH)5(abzm)10]·4C7H8 (C238H227Eu5O45; bulk desolvated C210H195Eu5O45). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 5 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
